  "scope": "A single kind cluster runs isolated Zot v2.1.23 registries for one exact repo and authenticated case-owned OCI Distribution API client. The open policy allows read/create/update/delete; the guarded policy allows read/create only. Two fixed inert OCI manifests exercise initial tag creation, same-tag overwrite, digest readback, and manifest deletion/recreation. The case checks the native audit file and filtered HTTP access events for these operations. Cloud-vendor controls, durable audit forwarding, administrator controls, sync/retention behavior, or protections against registry storage administrators.",
